==English==

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɜː(r)ki}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|perk|ier}}

# [[lively|Lively]] or [[enthusiastic]].
#: ''She answered with a '''perky''' smile and bounced off.''
# {{context|disparaging}} [[lively|Lively]] or [[enthusiastic]] in a [[pointed]], [[deliberate]], or [[exaggerated]] way, or to an [[annoying]] degree
#: ''I'm sure he could be just as effective a motivational speaker without being so damn perky.''
# Standing [[upright]]; [[firm]].
#: ''The plant looks much '''perkier''' since I watered it.''

